flowchart TB
  accTitle: The public boundary of DorkOS Cloud
  accDescr: Optional local Cloud clients use HTTPS. Legacy app-side paths coexist with the versioned public contract. The versioned client resolves authenticated instance identity before minting scoped inference credentials under the same current link. Claude Code may use the returned inference endpoint when explicitly enabled. The existing tunnel is a separate route to the local server.
  subgraph app["Open-source app · local machine"]
    local["Local DorkOS server<br/>Runs without a Cloud link"]
    legacy["Cloud link + managed services client<br/>Existing /api/auth and /api/instances calls"]
    versioned["Versioned client<br/>@dork-labs/cloud-api/client"]
    runtime["Claude Code inference configuration<br/>Explicit credits opt-in + current link"]
    tunnel["Existing tunnel manager<br/>ngrok SDK · optional"]
    local --> legacy
    local --> versioned
    local --> runtime
    local --> tunnel
  end
  control["Configured service origin<br/>DORKOS_CLOUD_URL; defaults to website<br/>Account handover is route-specific"]
  remote["Managed remote command consumer<br/>Draft only · enrollment + ingress gates"]
  remote -.->|"Unwired command SSE + lease/ack"| control
  inference["Inference endpoint<br/>URL + scoped token returned at runtime"]
  contract["Public contract: packages/cloud-api<br/>Schemas + route table + fixtures<br/>Accounts · instances · managed services<br/>entitlements · seats · remote access · inference<br/>Hosted-community start / claim / moves"]
  edge["Tunnel service"]
  browser["Remote browser"]
  legacy -->|"HTTPS: device link, heartbeat,<br/>managed actions + event pull/ack"| control
  versioned -->|"HTTPS /v1 · bearer auth<br/>Session identity → inference mint<br/>Same credential / origin / generation"| control
  contract -.->|"Contract describes wire;<br/>not a deployment guarantee"| control
  runtime -->|"Inference protocol over HTTPS<br/>when enabled"| inference
  tunnel -->|"Outbound tunnel connection"| edge
  browser -->|"HTTPS / WSS"| edge
  edge -->|"Forward app traffic through tunnel"| local
  community["Community host API · implemented<br/>Scoped keys · limits · usage<br/>Community owns content and storage"]
  control -.->|"Hosting contract · availability-dependent<br/>HTTPS host API; no database access"| community
